OL,3,GNEWSAInjunction halts unauthorised work
OL,4,Aat wildlife spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court injunction has been
OL,7,Fsecured to halt the unauthorised use of
OL,8,Fdiggers ripping up a wildlife hot spot.
OL,10,FHundreds of residents have arrived at
OL,11,Fthe field off Sheering Mill Lane in
OL,12,FSawbridgeworth to voice their anger at
OL,13,Fthe work, which began on Saturday.
OL,15,FAhead of the court order being imposed,
OL,16,Feyewitnesses described diggers tearing
OL,17,Fthe field apart and truck-loads of
OL,18,Fmaterial being delivered there.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
